---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Anna.I"
  description="The terms and conditions for using Anna.I's home-services coordination platform."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-content" style="max-width: 48rem;">
      <div class="mb-12 reveal">
        <span class="badge mb-5">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="text-fluid-3xl mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="font-mono-label text-slate\/40">Last updated: July 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; color: var(--slate); line-height: 1.7;">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-fluid-xl mb-3">1. Acceptance</h2>
          <p class="text-slate\/70">By registering for or using Anna.I, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the service. Anna.I provides a coordination platform connecting households with vetted service vendors in Singapore.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-fluid-xl mb-3">2. Escrow payments</h2>
          <p class="text-slate\/70">Payment for each job is held in escrow before work begins. Payment is released to the vendor only when the job is verified complete via photo proof. If a dispute arises, Anna.I mediates and may withhold payment pending resolution.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-fluid-xl mb-3">3. Vendor obligations</h2>
          <p class="text-slate\/70">Vendors must complete jobs as quoted, upload photo proof of completion, and maintain the standards expected of a vetted network member. Anna.I may remove vendors from the network for repeated failures, no-shows, or misconduct.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-fluid-xl mb-3">4. Household obligations</h2>
          <p class="text-slate\/70">Households must provide accurate home access information, approve quoted prices before work begins, and release escrow promptly upon verified completion. Abuse of the dispute system may result in account suspension.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-fluid-xl mb-3">5. Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-slate\/70">Anna.I is a coordination platform, not the service provider. Vendors are independent contractors responsible for their own work. Anna.I's liability is limited to the coordination fee charged for the job.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-fluid-xl mb-3">6. Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-slate\/70">For questions about these Terms, email hello@annai.sg.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
